{"about_the_game":"<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/688120/extras/eb239ae513cf833dd6350947f8a2ee8a.poster.avif?t=1748694112\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/688120/extras/eb239ae513cf833dd6350947f8a2ee8a.webm?t=1748694112\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/688120/extras/eb239ae513cf833dd6350947f8a2ee8a.mp4?t=1748694112\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>TOXICANT offers a sinister twist on the survival horror genre, featuring randomized levels and roguelike elements.<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Traverse a series of increasingly difficult randomized levels, upgrading your stats and gear along the way<br></li><li>Use items like compasses, maps, beacons, and the MonPro 2000 to help you navigate the depths of the mines<br></li><li>Collect miners' notes and secret documents to learn the story of a conspiracy gone horribly wrong<br></li><li>Sample an assortment of nourishment and libations in your quest to survive: expired canned food, toxic mushrooms, rancid wine, and more!<br></li><li>Salvage old mining equipment and use it as a weapon, or a shield! (Can't find any? How about a board with a nail in it!)</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/688120/extras/9c191f0f38c814c4ffb4aa88a614d911.poster.avif?t=1748694112\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/688120/extras/9c191f0f38c814c4ffb4aa88a614d911.webm?t=1748694112\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/688120/extras/9c191f0f38c814c4ffb4aa88a614d911.mp4?t=1748694112\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Randomized levels<br></li><li>Gamepad support<br></li><li>Volumetric lighting<br></li><li>Supports multiple styles of play, including pacifist</li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"icon":"e3ee2319ab3ed8e3760d5e9088a6a3c183796e83.jpg","localized_name":"It Begins","name":"It Begins","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/688120/e3ee2319ab3ed8e3760d5e9088a6a3c183796e83.jpg"},{"icon":"d2c556842c640bd98ad2768b6be10c0fe8b76ac6.jpg","localized_name":"On Your Way","name":"On Your Way","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/688120/d2c556842c640bd98ad2768b6be10c0fe8b76ac6.jpg"},{"icon":"3ca2b6e989eb7285bbd9ce2ce340f83f95854897.jpg","localized_name":"Ultimate Sacrifice","name":"Ultimate Sacrifice","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/688120/3ca2b6e989eb7285bbd9ce2ce340f83f95854897.jpg"},{"icon":"e48c7752c56e2ab7be06051050b673f6d32f9455.jpg","localized_name":"Self-preservation","name":"Self-preservation","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/688120/e48c7752c56e2ab7be06051050b673f6d32f9455.jpg"},{"icon":"d0e1db2544e9a085564250d68788ea702bca8027.jpg","localized_name":"Bingedrinker","name":"Bingedrinker","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/688120/d0e1db2544e9a085564250d68788ea702bca8027.jpg"},{"icon":"dd4a97605b927f86d778349f72134a278c5697d2.jpg","localized_name":"Overdose","name":"Overdose","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/688120/dd4a97605b927f86d778349f72134a278c5697d2.jpg"},{"icon":"739b165c5ccb8a68639aa3c5ef184c03c7a6eb7c.jpg","localized_name":"Beacon Expert","name":"Beacon Expert","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/688120/739b165c5ccb8a68639aa3c5ef184c03c7a6eb7c.jpg"},{"icon":"4f1c55817fd